                                                  <http://purl.org/pav/providedBy> "http://geneontology.org"^^xsd:string ;
                                                  rdfs:comment "Built from UniProt FGF23 (Q9EPC2) curation and PMID:26235988, read as ABSTRACT ONLY (no open full text), hence EXP evidence; FGFR3-ERK1/2 step taken from the UniProt annotation of that paper and should be verified against full text. Osteopontin MF unknown (root MF, ND). Klotho-independent. Rat calvaria data (PMID:18282132, FGFR TK-dependent suppression of osteoblast differentiation) not used in this mouse model."^^xsd:string ;
                                                  <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/in_taxon> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_10090> .

